  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"全局配置\" id=\"全局配置\" class=\"lake-lineheight-3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u20b36cb7\" id=\"u20b36cb7\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">全局配置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u1f4cc00a\" id=\"u1f4cc00a\" class=\"lake-lineheight-3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u63e1b450\" id=\"u63e1b450\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">直接配置gh-proxy.org的为全局代理，后续所有的git操作都将通过gh-proxy.org进行加速。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u33913a00\" id=\"u33913a00\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0adf8098\" id=\"u0adf8098\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: rgba(60, 60, 67, 0.56); background-color: rgb(246, 246, 247)\">bash</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%5Cngit%20config%20--global%20url.%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fgh-proxy.org%2Fhttps%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F%5C%22.insteadOf%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X0n1h%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u43e047b3\" id=\"u43e047b3\" class=\"lake-lineheight-15\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u299fca51\" id=\"u299fca51\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgba(60, 60, 67, 0.56); background-color: rgb(246, 246, 247)\">1</span><span data-lake-id=\"u667f1dcb\" id=\"u667f1dcb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgba(60, 60, 67, 0.56); background-color: rgb(246, 246, 247)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u0a29d3f8\" id=\"u0a29d3f8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgba(60, 60, 67, 0.56); background-color: rgb(246, 246, 247)\">2</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"单次git-clone代理\" id=\"单次git-clone代理\" class=\"lake-lineheight-3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc119d5f\" id=\"ufc119d5f\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">单次git clone代理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u31c9fad2\" id=\"u31c9fad2\" class=\"lake-lineheight-3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u97319838\" id=\"u97319838\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">如果只需要单次git clone加速，可以在clone命令中添加代理参数。只需要将clone的地址前面添加</span><a href=\"https://gh-proxy.org/%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E7%94%A8%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%E3%80%82\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u247f3fcc\" id=\"u247f3fcc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6bcb8d39\" id=\"u6bcb8d39\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 81, 178)\">https://gh-proxy.org/，不要用空格。</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u03641f8f\" id=\"u03641f8f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf7e97c33\" id=\"uf7e97c33\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: rgba(60, 60, 67, 0.56); background-color: rgb(246, 246, 247)\">bash</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%8D%95%E6%AC%A1git%20clone%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%5Cngit%20clone%20https%3A%2F%2Fgh-proxy.org%2Fhttps%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FWJQSERVER-STUDIO%2Fghproxy%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uKeTh%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5919700e\" id=\"u5919700e\" class=\"lake-lineheight-15\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u86c1ca79\" id=\"u86c1ca79\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgba(60, 60, 67, 0.56); background-color: rgb(246, 246, 247)\">1</span><span data-lake-id=\"u087d6306\" id=\"u087d6306\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgba(60, 60, 67, 0.56); background-color: rgb(246, 246, 247)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u906a2a78\" id=\"u906a2a78\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgba(60, 60, 67, 0.56); background-color: rgb(246, 246, 247)\">2</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"使用gitee的github同步功能\" id=\"使用gitee的github同步功能\" class=\"lake-lineheight-3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6e19d12\" id=\"ue6e19d12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">使用Gitee的GitHub同步功能</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u5f9e883c\" id=\"u5f9e883c\" class=\"lake-lineheight-3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5677ec69\" id=\"u5677ec69\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(60, 60, 67)\">Gitee支持从GitHub拉取一个项目到Gitee，往往在一分钟内即可完成。在Gitee上拉取代码完全是国内网络，速度最快。 具体可以参考Gitee官方文档：</span><a href=\"https://help.gitee.com/questions/GitHub%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5Gitee%E5%8F%8A%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue5a81d22\" id=\"ue5a81d22\"><span data-lake-id=\"u83572297\" id=\"u83572297\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 81, 178)\">GitHub/GitLab 仓库快速导入 Gitee 及同步更新</span></a></p>",
